WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.670
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:31.970 --> 00:01:33.750
After finding the third legendary kitchenware,

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:35.840
the Demon Saint Bronze,

00:01:36.340 --> 00:01:38.020
in order to find the next kitchenware,

00:01:38.180 --> 00:01:39.560
we walked directly north.

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:46.340
We walked for a long time,

00:01:46.420 --> 00:01:48.770
but the surrounding area was just deserted.

00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:50.360
There is no food

00:01:50.590 --> 00:01:52.000
at all.

00:02:01.980 --> 00:02:03.520
I'm so hungry, Mao.

00:02:03.570 --> 00:02:05.770
We only had water for these three days.

00:02:06.230 --> 00:02:07.310
I thought Chef Xie

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:09.040
used to travel a lot.

00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:11.000
So there is nothing to worry about.

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:13.380
But he led us here.

00:02:13.430 --> 00:02:14.310
Look at you!

00:02:14.550 --> 00:02:15.510
Do you think that

00:02:15.560 --> 00:02:16.260
the legendary kitchenware

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:17.830
can be found on any street?

00:02:18.010 --> 00:02:19.600
We have to find it in such places.

00:02:19.810 --> 00:02:21.910
But at least there must be a plan.

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:24.510
So that we can prepare food.

00:02:24.610 --> 00:02:25.790
Stop quarreling.

00:02:25.980 --> 00:02:26.830
Anyway,

00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:29.250
it's important to find something to eat.

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:35.880
Well.

00:02:41.900 --> 00:02:43.770
I am too weak to laugh.

00:02:47.230 --> 00:02:48.260
I think there should be food

00:02:48.650 --> 00:02:50.370
in that mountain.

00:02:50.630 --> 00:02:52.140
OK, hold on for a while.

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:53.410
Come on.

00:02:54.930 --> 00:02:59.100
Labyrinth of Darkness! Heart-Connecting Serving of Congee

00:03:08.190 --> 00:03:09.810
Hold on, Mao.

00:03:09.880 --> 00:03:10.890
You are so energetic.

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:12.500
I can't stand it anymore.

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:15.120
Neither can I.

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:17.430
Any help?

00:03:17.570 --> 00:03:18.760
I can't make it.

00:03:18.810 --> 00:03:20.430
My ears feel weird.

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:24.740
What is this?

00:03:25.980 --> 00:03:27.110
It's food.

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:29.230
Anyone there?

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:30.230
Help.

00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:30.850
It hurts.

00:03:31.180 --> 00:03:32.130
I heard someone's voice.

00:03:34.640 --> 00:03:35.690
Who's there?

00:03:36.770 --> 00:03:39.240
Help!

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:43.400
Fortunately we passed by here.

00:03:43.710 --> 00:03:44.960
What happened, granny?

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:46.150
On the way back to the village,

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:48.740
I accidentally fell.

00:03:49.520 --> 00:03:50.930
Is there a village nearby?

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:52.810
Is there anything to eat in the village?

00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:54.040
There are vegetables, fruits,

00:03:54.110 --> 00:03:56.110
pork, chicken and eggs

00:03:56.450 --> 00:03:58.170
in the village.

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:00.680
Granny.

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:02.510
I'll send you back to the village.

00:04:02.640 --> 00:04:03.260
I can't make it.

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:06.050
My waist was twisted and I couldn't move.

00:04:07.130 --> 00:04:09.110
Can you find someone to help me?

00:04:09.340 --> 00:04:10.580
But I can't

00:04:10.630 --> 00:04:11.600
leave you here alone.

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:14.320
You just have to leave the water for me.

00:04:14.830 --> 00:04:15.430
With water,

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:18.090
I can hold on until you come back.

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:23.920
You left her there alone.

00:04:24.380 --> 00:04:25.540
Is that okay?

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:27.240
No problem.

00:04:27.310 --> 00:04:28.000
As long as we find the village,

00:04:28.050 --> 00:04:29.270
We’ll have everything,

00:04:29.340 --> 00:04:30.470
whether it is water or food.

00:04:31.230 --> 00:04:31.700
But I don't think

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:34.130
there is a village.

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:36.080
She said that there is a cave
at the bottom of the mountain,

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:37.490
which is a shortcut to the village.

00:04:37.550 --> 00:04:38.940
It's over there.

00:04:43.150 --> 00:04:44.210
This is rock salt.

00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:46.420
Does anyone really live here?

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:47.930
We should be able to see the intersection of the village

00:04:47.980 --> 00:04:50.070
after passing through here.

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:51.670
Come on, Mao.

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:54.840
Watch out!

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:05.100
Mao!

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:08.570
Mao! Meili!

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:11.720
Are you there, Mao?

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:15.430
Mao! Meili!

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:18.740
Meili, are you okay?

00:05:18.990 --> 00:05:20.500
Meili! Meili!

00:05:21.450 --> 00:05:22.810
What happened?

00:05:23.350 --> 00:05:24.500
The cliff collapsed.

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:25.500
Mao.

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:27.660
Meili, answer me.

00:05:29.210 --> 00:05:29.980
Mao.

00:05:35.510 --> 00:05:37.110
No way, it's completely blocked.

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:38.930
That means we...

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:41.310
Silang, can you hear me?

00:05:42.330 --> 00:05:43.130
Mao.

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:45.180
It's useless, kid.

00:05:52.020 --> 00:05:52.800
Granny.

00:05:53.730 --> 00:05:56.250
I just wanted to catch you two.

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:59.060
Unexpectedly, I caught him.

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:02.360
You are Xiang En.

00:06:03.310 --> 00:06:05.020
Your name is Silang, right?

00:06:05.690 --> 00:06:06.640
Go tell Steel Bar Xie

00:06:06.690 --> 00:06:08.390
and Seven-Star Knife Lei En.

00:06:08.960 --> 00:06:10.470
If you want to save Mao

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:11.480
and that girl,

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:13.700
hand over the legendary kitchenware.

00:06:13.870 --> 00:06:14.950
Are you kidding?

00:06:15.280 --> 00:06:16.380
How could the legendary kitchenware

00:06:16.430 --> 00:06:18.150
be handed over to the Dark Cooking Society.

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:21.280
Let me tell you

00:06:21.330 --> 00:06:22.760
what the name of this cave is.

00:06:24.070 --> 00:06:25.500
The Dark maze.

00:06:26.340 --> 00:06:27.140
In other words,

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:28.250
this cave is actually a dark maze

00:06:28.540 --> 00:06:30.660
with only entry but no exit.

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:34.790
Only this mouse

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:36.270
knows the exit of the maze.

00:06:36.850 --> 00:06:38.940
As long as you hand over the legendary kitchenware,

00:06:39.130 --> 00:06:41.060
I will give this mouse to you.

00:06:41.760 --> 00:06:42.550
If you refuse,

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:43.940
they can only keep looking for an exit

00:06:43.990 --> 00:06:45.390
in the dark

00:06:45.530 --> 00:06:47.420
until they die of exhaustion.

00:06:47.910 --> 00:06:48.920
How come?

00:06:49.250 --> 00:06:51.150
Mao won't die so easily.

00:06:51.250 --> 00:06:52.530
I don't know.

00:06:52.580 --> 00:06:53.660
Look around.

00:06:54.700 --> 00:06:56.850
There is no water in this place.

00:06:58.580 --> 00:06:59.110
Let's see

00:06:59.160 --> 00:07:01.010
how long they can live.

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:05.510
My kettle.

00:07:05.750 --> 00:07:08.000
You can discuss it.

00:07:16.460 --> 00:07:18.530
This is bad.

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:22.660
Mao, where are you?

00:07:23.390 --> 00:07:25.920
Mao.

00:07:26.230 --> 00:07:28.470
Meili, here I am.

00:07:31.170 --> 00:07:31.910
Hold on.

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:33.660
I will light the fire.

00:07:39.210 --> 00:07:41.300
Fortunately, I brought the cooking oil.

00:07:53.030 --> 00:07:55.050
It's okay, Meili.

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:58.230
What's wrong with me?

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:01.420
Let's take a look inside.

00:08:01.980 --> 00:08:03.810
We have to find a way out.

00:08:11.560 --> 00:08:12.030
It's dark here.

00:08:12.080 --> 00:08:13.260
Watch your steps.

00:08:13.500 --> 00:08:14.100
Thanks.

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:18.710
Don't let me go.

00:08:22.860 --> 00:08:23.960
Are you okay? Let's go.

00:08:25.030 --> 00:08:25.780
I am fine.

00:08:40.960 --> 00:08:41.940
There is a fork here.

00:08:42.260 --> 00:08:43.360
Which way should we go?

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:46.020
I have no clue.

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:48.150
It's like a maze.

00:08:48.870 --> 00:08:51.190
When can we get out?

00:08:52.110 --> 00:08:54.170
My throat is so dry.

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:55.190
Mine, too.

00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:04.430
What's up? Any found?

00:09:07.530 --> 00:09:08.480
It's the sound of water.

00:09:09.140 --> 00:09:10.730
Where is it?

00:09:18.340 --> 00:09:19.010
Here.

00:09:21.880 --> 00:09:23.140
Why so narrow?

00:09:23.570 --> 00:09:25.240
There is no way to hold a torch.

00:09:26.200 --> 00:09:26.980
I'm so scared.

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:28.930
Don't worry. Just hold me.

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:56.360
It's water.

00:10:00.100 --> 00:10:01.150
Meili, come here.

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:05.410
Mao.

00:10:05.800 --> 00:10:06.360
I am okay.

00:10:06.760 --> 00:10:07.420
The water is undrinkable?

00:10:08.150 --> 00:10:09.410
This is almost the same as sea water.

00:10:10.350 --> 00:10:12.420
The rock salt in this area is dissolved in the water.

00:10:13.150 --> 00:10:15.120
We finally found water.

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:19.820
I can't hold it anymore.

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:33.520
Probably traveling businessmen.

00:10:34.260 --> 00:10:36.010
They can’t walk any longer.

00:10:38.020 --> 00:10:38.620
What is that?

00:10:38.830 --> 00:10:39.980
Something like a pot

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:42.300
If we can't get out,

00:10:42.350 --> 00:10:44.130
will we also become like this?

00:10:45.280 --> 00:10:48.320
I don't want to be like this.

00:10:49.300 --> 00:10:50.260
We will be fine.

00:10:50.570 --> 00:10:51.700
Be strong, Meili.

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:53.730
Stop crying.

00:10:54.140 --> 00:10:55.020
The fire is going out.

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:05.970
The only food is the shiitake mushrooms we just found

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:09.380
and a little raw rice.

00:11:11.680 --> 00:11:13.170
But nothing can be made

00:11:13.240 --> 00:11:14.280
without fresh water.

00:11:19.670 --> 00:11:21.470
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:11:26.420 --> 00:11:28.780
I'm so hungry that I can't do anything.

00:11:29.140 --> 00:11:31.070
No matter how strong you are,

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:32.520
I'm afraid you can't break it.

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:36.680
You are so calm.

00:11:37.200 --> 00:11:38.850
Mao and Meili

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:39.850
are locked up in this cave

00:11:39.900 --> 00:11:41.140
without food and drink.

00:11:44.150 --> 00:11:44.790
How about it?

00:11:45.490 --> 00:11:46.660
Would you like

00:11:46.710 --> 00:11:49.150
to exchange the legendary kitchenware for their lives?

00:11:49.340 --> 00:11:51.330
Xiang En, you are so mean.

00:11:51.550 --> 00:11:52.160
No matter what happens,

00:11:52.210 --> 00:11:53.500
the legendary kitchenware

00:11:53.770 --> 00:11:55.470
can't be handed over to the Dark Cooking Society.

00:11:55.770 --> 00:11:57.780
You always love to overexert.

00:11:57.890 --> 00:11:59.750
See how long you can last.

00:12:00.580 --> 00:12:01.210
Piss off.

00:12:03.370 --> 00:12:04.350
If you change your mind,

00:12:04.400 --> 00:12:05.340
call me anytime.

00:12:08.530 --> 00:12:09.490
I can't make it.

00:12:09.610 --> 00:12:10.850
Come on. Hold on.

00:12:11.820 --> 00:12:13.270
You have to keep going.

00:12:13.570 --> 00:12:14.170
Mao.

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:16.480
You have to keep going.

00:12:17.070 --> 00:12:19.540
I am so sleepy.

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:20.830
Don't sleep.

00:12:21.080 --> 00:12:22.190
We will be saved.

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:23.690
Don't give up.

00:12:24.070 --> 00:12:25.110
I am so sleepy.

00:12:27.400 --> 00:12:28.060
Meili.

00:12:30.480 --> 00:12:34.270
You used to cheer for me.

00:12:35.210 --> 00:12:36.500
When I first arrived in Guangzhou

00:12:37.010 --> 00:12:39.230
to take Zhou Yu's loess test.

00:12:40.050 --> 00:12:42.150
When I took the super chef exam.

00:12:44.680 --> 00:12:45.610
It is because of your company

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:46.850
that I could overcome difficulties.

00:12:47.800 --> 00:12:50.050
But why am I at a loss

00:12:50.350 --> 00:12:51.570
at this moment?

00:12:52.780 --> 00:12:54.040
I always say that the responsibility of a chef

00:12:54.090 --> 00:12:55.430
is to bring people happiness.

00:12:56.030 --> 00:12:57.510
If I can't even save my beloved,

00:12:58.120 --> 00:12:59.180
I am not worthy to be a chef at all.

00:13:01.140 --> 00:13:01.850
Not at all.

00:13:05.820 --> 00:13:07.040
We must decide before dawn.

00:13:07.730 --> 00:13:09.020
They haven't eaten

00:13:09.420 --> 00:13:10.730
or drunk for three days.

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:13.360
It will be too late.

00:13:13.990 --> 00:13:15.900
We can't just watch them die.

00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:17.630
Now we can only hand over the kitchenware

00:13:17.680 --> 00:13:18.430
to the Dark Cooking Society.

00:13:19.040 --> 00:13:20.840
Mao, Meili.

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:30.060
Mom, please help me.

00:13:30.730 --> 00:13:33.140
I have to find a way to save her.

00:13:34.980 --> 00:13:35.720
Mom.

00:13:36.740 --> 00:13:37.510
Mom.

00:13:44.230 --> 00:13:44.820
Mom.

00:14:02.210 --> 00:14:02.790
This is...

00:14:09.910 --> 00:14:11.390
That's it.

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:15.180
Wait for me, Meili.

00:14:18.220 --> 00:14:20.860
Shiitake Mushroom. Raw Rice.

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:26.840
It's all my fault.

00:14:27.520 --> 00:14:29.020
I got you into trouble.

00:14:29.100 --> 00:14:31.040
So noisy. Be quite.

00:14:31.310 --> 00:14:32.390
But...

00:14:41.960 --> 00:14:43.820
I did it!

00:14:50.900 --> 00:14:52.750
Open your mouth.

00:14:56.360 --> 00:14:57.480
Mao, this is...?

00:14:57.730 --> 00:14:58.500
This is porridge.

00:14:58.760 --> 00:14:59.250
Don't worry.

00:14:59.650 --> 00:15:01.270
All the salt is removed.

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:03.140
What about you?

00:15:03.490 --> 00:15:04.590
I ate some.

00:15:05.160 --> 00:15:06.830
These are all for you.

00:15:07.060 --> 00:15:09.470
Liar, you didn't eat.

00:15:09.670 --> 00:15:11.110
Open your mouth.

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:13.130
No, leave me alone.

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:14.970
Hang on.

00:15:15.940 --> 00:15:18.140
I have never done anything

00:15:18.190 --> 00:15:19.650
for you before.

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:21.770
This porridge is the first time

00:15:21.820 --> 00:15:24.750
I have cooked for you.

00:15:26.450 --> 00:15:27.150
Mao.

00:15:28.120 --> 00:15:28.610
Here.

00:15:30.210 --> 00:15:30.800
Mao.

00:15:34.230 --> 00:15:35.510
How is it? Does it taste good?

00:15:44.410 --> 00:15:45.530
The rest is for you.

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:47.060
It's okay.

00:15:48.320 --> 00:15:49.630
Then we take turns eating.

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:02.920
Meili.

00:16:03.960 --> 00:16:05.710
I never had a chance to tell you.

00:16:06.920 --> 00:16:08.730
Actually, I...

00:16:14.500 --> 00:16:15.180
Meili.

00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:25.920
What happened to you?

00:16:26.670 --> 00:16:27.370
There's a way out.

00:16:31.290 --> 00:16:32.880
There's a way out.

00:16:33.910 --> 00:16:34.570
Just from there.

00:16:34.850 --> 00:16:35.760
There is a hole above.

00:16:36.130 --> 00:16:37.360
We have to climb there.

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:38.500
I can't make it.

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:39.960
You should go alone.

00:16:40.090 --> 00:16:41.630
I won't leave you.

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:44.200
Hold me tight.

00:16:56.820 --> 00:16:57.580
Go away.

00:17:01.390 --> 00:17:02.700
Don't let go.

00:17:05.650 --> 00:17:07.790
How can I die here?

00:17:08.300 --> 00:17:11.760
I have a lot to do.

00:17:15.200 --> 00:17:16.650
Okay, we have to decide.

00:17:17.310 --> 00:17:18.400
The legendary kitchenware

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:22.100
or the lives of Mao and Meili.

00:17:24.080 --> 00:17:24.640
Which one?

00:17:27.630 --> 00:17:29.900
I'll go to the toilet first.

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:33.900
Look, we are out.

00:17:40.230 --> 00:17:42.290
It's so stressful

00:17:42.500 --> 00:17:44.210
to face such a critical decision.

00:17:48.320 --> 00:17:50.850
Why are bats flying out of here?

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:57.870
Meili, never let go.

00:17:58.430 --> 00:18:00.130
Mao, are you okay?

00:18:03.410 --> 00:18:04.220
I can't make it.

00:18:15.880 --> 00:18:16.590
So,

00:18:16.860 --> 00:18:17.920
you decided to hand over

00:18:17.970 --> 00:18:18.980
the legendary kitchenware?

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:22.600
Just take it.

00:18:32.080 --> 00:18:33.950
This isn't the legendary kitchenware.

00:18:34.260 --> 00:18:35.320
What is this?

00:18:35.490 --> 00:18:36.630
This is called the steam boiler.

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:39.900
How come?

00:18:40.380 --> 00:18:42.710
This pot is our savior.

00:18:43.380 --> 00:18:44.460
It belongs to a businessman

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:47.230
who died in this cave

00:18:47.920 --> 00:18:49.420
This is the magical kitchenware

00:18:49.540 --> 00:18:50.900
that can turn seawater into freshwater

00:18:51.310 --> 00:18:53.960
that appeared in Yunnan Province more than 50 years ago.

00:18:54.690 --> 00:18:56.450
Turn seawater into freshwater?

00:18:56.940 --> 00:18:58.350
Put the container with saltwater

00:18:58.400 --> 00:18:59.100
on the fire,

00:18:59.310 --> 00:19:02.150
and then put the steam pot with the ingredients on it.

00:19:02.650 --> 00:19:03.510
After it boils,

00:19:03.750 --> 00:19:05.760
steam will come out of that little hole.

00:19:06.010 --> 00:19:07.220
When the steam meets the lid,

00:19:07.470 --> 00:19:08.620
it turns into distilled water.

00:19:09.720 --> 00:19:11.870
So although we had no water,

00:19:11.920 --> 00:19:12.870
we survived.

00:19:13.240 --> 00:19:15.820
Meanwhile, smoke guided the way out.

00:19:18.440 --> 00:19:19.050
Xiang En.

00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:21.350
No matter what despicable means you use,

00:19:21.610 --> 00:19:23.320
God is on our side.

00:19:27.120 --> 00:19:30.050
Liu Maoxing, I lost to you again.

00:19:30.950 --> 00:19:33.120
I don't think I can return to the Dark Cooking Society.

00:19:34.080 --> 00:19:34.650
Goodbye.

00:19:37.520 --> 00:19:38.100
Xiang En.

00:19:46.520 --> 00:19:47.180
Xiang En.

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:00.390
Mao.

00:20:01.610 --> 00:20:03.150
Why are you holding your hands together?

00:20:04.150 --> 00:20:05.040
Well...

00:20:05.390 --> 00:20:07.150
Because it's dark and slippery inside.

00:20:07.200 --> 00:20:08.890
He said I couldn't let go.

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:11.720
What happened there?

00:20:12.830 --> 00:20:14.630
I see.

00:20:15.220 --> 00:20:17.630
It seems that only bats know the truth.

00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:19.900
Even Lei En is...

00:20:23.040 --> 00:20:24.340
There is a village ahead.

00:20:28.010 --> 00:20:29.260
What's wrong, Lei En?

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:31.590
There is a central official.

00:20:36.410 --> 00:20:37.300
Provincial Military Commander Li.

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:38.640
Really.

00:20:38.790 --> 00:20:40.390
Why is he here?

00:20:40.720 --> 00:20:43.340
Is it Provincial Military Commander Li

00:20:43.390 --> 00:20:44.100
who has been serving as the chief supervisor

00:20:44.200 --> 00:20:45.690
in the royal kitchen?

00:20:45.960 --> 00:20:47.920
Yes, when I was in Sichuan and Guangzhou,

00:20:47.950 --> 00:20:49.380
he treated me very well.

00:20:49.770 --> 00:20:51.410
Provincial Military Commander Li.

00:20:52.920 --> 00:20:53.830
Mao.

00:20:54.380 --> 00:20:55.220
Provincial Military Commander Li.

00:20:55.700 --> 00:20:57.120
Mao, I am looking for you.

00:20:57.410 --> 00:20:59.170
Long time no see.

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:00.510
I heard from Ruoh that

00:21:00.700 --> 00:21:03.430
you are out for the legendary kitchen wares.

00:21:03.740 --> 00:21:04.580
So I caught up.

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:09.430
Steel Bar Xie and Seven-Star Knife Lei En.

00:21:10.820 --> 00:21:13.640
I am Silang, the chief disciple of Mao.

00:21:13.940 --> 00:21:14.420
Mao.

00:21:14.690 --> 00:21:16.120
You better go back with me now.

00:21:16.490 --> 00:21:18.360
I need your strength.

00:21:18.800 --> 00:21:20.010
Chef Xie, Lei En.

00:21:20.270 --> 00:21:22.090
Hope you can help me too.

00:21:23.010 --> 00:21:24.490
It is said that the Dark Cooking Society

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:27.340
is targeting at Beijing where the emperor is.

00:21:29.440 --> 00:21:30.400
The Dark Cooking Society...

00:21:32.810 --> 00:21:34.760
Xiang En failed as expected.

00:21:35.510 --> 00:21:36.300
Forget it.

00:21:37.170 --> 00:21:38.790
I didn't count on her anyway.

00:21:39.440 --> 00:21:40.310
Lin Chefs.

00:21:41.330 --> 00:21:43.600
It's your time to show.

00:21:44.410 --> 00:21:46.440
Control the world with cooking

00:21:47.090 --> 00:21:48.620
is the goal of the Dark Cooking Society.

00:21:48.900 --> 00:21:50.020
Start off.

00:23:14.976 --> 00:23:16.979
Preview of the next episode

00:23:17.623 --> 00:23:21.986
When we sneaked into the Forbidden City to
stop the conspiracy of the Dark Cooking Society,

00:23:22.158 --> 00:23:25.263
we were shocked to see
the new head chef sent by the underground.

00:23:26.401 --> 00:23:27.205
Oh, you're...

00:23:27.894 --> 00:23:29.292
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:29.432 --> 00:23:30.610
Imperial Capital Peking!

00:23:30.610 --> 00:23:32.327
The Dark Cooking Society Bares Its Fangs

00:23:32.656 --> 00:23:33.914
It will definitely be interesting!
